  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> that the Connection was obtained from",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 获取该连接的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> from the current <a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从当前的<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>中获取<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Is aware of a corresponding Connection bound to the current\n<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>. Will bind a Connection to the\n<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a> if transaction synchronization is active.",
      "translation": "知晓当前已绑定到 `<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>` 的相应 `Connection`。如果事务同步处于活动状态，则将绑定一个 `Connection` 到 `<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Is aware of a corresponding Connection bound to the current\n<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>. Will bind a Connection to the\n<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a> if transaction synchronization is active",
      "translation": "知道当前已绑定到 `<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>` 的相应 `Connection`。如果事务同步处于活动状态，则将绑定一个 `Connection` 到 `<a href=\"../../transaction/reactive/TransactionSynchronizationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.reactive\"><code>TransactionSynchronizationManager</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned DataAccessException is supposed to contain the original\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/R2dbcException.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>R2dbcException</code></a> as root cause. However, client code may not generally\nrely on this due to DataAccessExceptions possibly being caused by other resource\nAPIs as well. That said, a <code>getRootCause() instanceof R2dbcException</code>\ncheck (and subsequent cast) is considered reliable when expecting R2DBC-based\naccess to have happened.",
      "translation": "返回的 `DataAccessException` 应包含原始的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/R2dbcException.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>R2dbcException</code></a>` 作为根本原因。然而，客户端代码通常不能依赖这一点，因为 `DataAccessException` 也可能由其他资源 API 引起。尽管如此，当预期已发生基于 R2DBC 的访问时，执行 `<code>getRootCause() instanceof R2dbcException</code>` 检查（并随后进行类型转换）被认为是可靠的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Used internally by Spring's <code>DatabaseClient</code>, Spring's R2DBC operation\nobjects. Can also be used directly in application code.",
      "translation": "由 Spring 的 `<code>DatabaseClient</code>` 和 Spring 的 R2DBC 操作对象内部使用。也可直接在应用程序代码中使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the innermost target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>.\nIf the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> is wrapped, it will be unwrapped until a\nplain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> is found. Otherwise, the passed-in Connection\nwill be returned as-is.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 的最内层目标 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。\n如果给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 被包装，则将其解包，直到找到普通的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。否则，按原样返回传入的 Connection。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Actually close the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>, obtained from the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>. Same as <a href=\"#releaseConnection(io.r2dbc.spi.Connection,io.r2dbc.spi.ConnectionFactory)\"><code>releaseConnection(Connection, ConnectionFactory)</code></a>,\nbut preserving the original exception.",
      "translation": "实际上关闭给定的、从给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>获取的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。与<a href=\"#releaseConnection(io.r2dbc.spi.Connection,io.r2dbc.spi.ConnectionFactory)\"><code>releaseConnection(Connection, ConnectionFactory)</code></a>相同，但保留原始异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Translate the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/R2dbcException.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>R2dbcException</code></a> into a generic <a href=\"../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/R2dbcException.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>R2dbcException</code></a>转换为通用的<a href=\"../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Close the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>, obtained from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>, if\nit is not managed externally (that is, not bound to the subscription).",
      "translation": "关闭从给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>获取的给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>，如果它不是由外部管理的（即未绑定到订阅）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Order value for ReactiveTransactionSynchronization objects that clean up R2DBC Connections.",
      "translation": "用于清理 R2DBC 连接的 ReactiveTransactionSynchronization 对象的订单值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> to obtain\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connections</code></a> from",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 用于从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 获取\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connections</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
